 190\" width=\"340\" height=\"190\"><title>JSON tree</title><desc>An object with three fields: nombre with &quot;Ana&quot;, edad with 15 and notas with an array of 7 and 9. field(&quot;edad&quot;) goes down to 15.</desc><rect x=\"110\" y=\"8\" width=\"120\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FF0008\" fill-opacity=\"0.14\" stroke=\"#FF0008\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"28.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\" fill=\"#FF0001\">object</text><path d=\"M 170 40 V 54 M 60 54 H 280 M 60 54 V 70 M 170 54 V 70 M 280 54 V 70\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF000B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><rect x=\"20\" y=\"72\" width=\"80\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FF0007\" fill-opacity=\"0.14\" stroke=\"#FF0007\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"92.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBMPlexMono\" fill=\"#FF0001\">&quot;Ana&quot;</text><rect x=\"130\" y=\"72\" width=\"80\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FF0006\" fill-opacity=\"0.14\" stroke=\"#FF0006\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"92.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBMPlexMono\" fill=\"#FF0001\">15</text><rect x=\"240\" y=\"72\" width=\"80\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FF0008\" fill-opacity=\"0.1\" stroke=\"#FF0008\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"92.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\" fill=\"#FF0001\">array</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FF000B\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\">nombre</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FF000B\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\">edad</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FF000B\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\">notas</text><path d=\"M 280 104 V 132 M 250 132 H 310 M 250 132 V 144 M 310 132 V 144\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF000B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><rect x=\"226\" y=\"146\" width=\"48\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\